---
import { businessConfig } from '../config';
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="container about-container">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img src="/barberia-demo/images/about-shop.png" alt="Leo Style Corp Barber Shop Experience" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="experience-badge">
        <span class="number">LEO</span>
        <span class="text">STYLE CORP</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span data-i18n="aboutTitlePart1">Más Que</span> <span class="text-gold" data-i18n="aboutTitlePart2">Un Corte de Cabello</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="about-lead" data-i18n="aboutLead">
        Leo Style Corp Barber Shop trae precisión, estilo urbano y cuidado masculino profesional para la comunidad en Newark, New Jersey.
      </p>
      <p class="about-text" data-i18n="aboutText1">
        Desde los fades más limpios y perfilados de barba personalizados hasta afeitados clásicos con toalla caliente, cada servicio tiene una meta clara: hacer que salgas luciendo impecable, con total confianza y listo para destacar.
      </p>
      <p class="about-text" data-i18n="aboutText2">
        Fusionamos la calidez y el ambiente de una barbería latina tradicional con las últimas tendencias de la moda urbana. Ven, relájate en nuestros sillones de cuero y deja que nuestro trabajo hable por sí mismo.
      </p>
      
      <div class="about-highlights">
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <span class="highlight-num text-gold">100%</span>
          <span class="highlight-label" data-i18n="aboutHighlight1">Enfoque en Precisión</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <span class="highlight-num text-gold">5★</span>
          <span class="highlight-label" data-i18n="aboutHighlight2">Reputación Local</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <span class="highlight-num text-gold">#1</span>
          <span class="highlight-label" data-i18n="aboutHighlight3">Estilo en Newark</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href={businessConfig.bookingUrl} class="btn-premium btn-primary" data-i18n="aboutBtn">Reservar Mi Sillón</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { translations } from './translations';
  window.addEventListener('langChanged', (e: any) => {
    const lang = e.detail.lang;
    document.querySelectorAll('#about [data-i18n]').forEach(el => {
      const key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n');
      if (key && translations[lang][key]) {
        el.textContent = translations[lang][key];
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
  }

  .about-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .about-image:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .experience-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .experience-badge .number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .experience-badge .text {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(245, 243, 237, 0.7);
  }

  .about-highlights {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 243, 237, 0.1);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .highlight-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .highlight-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(245, 243, 237, 0.5);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .about-cta {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .about-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
